Hey it's been a while! The game is in a bit more polished state now and it has a few new interesting things:
- First achievements!
- Fishing!
- Caught fishes will be spawned as members of your private army now;
- You can spend money on training the fishes;
- Some shops can be found in open space now, there are more stuff in space overall now;
- Working on new bosses;

Keep MECH PUNKING

- In-Cockpit Guide;
- Mobs spawning tweaks;
- Map Markers fixes;
- Guide on [T]urbo ang [G]ravity 
- Improved scanner - now it will show important objects offscreen;
- Nerfed mobs more, they wont bombard you on spawn;

join our [url=https://discord.gg/5KjNyDH]Discord[/url] to stay in touch
 [img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/42690989/24f037c2bef0953b62bc93f18744c72698ae7d01.png[/img]

Dev branch updates more often than the main one.

- Game will now pause for important quest/tutorial dialogues;
- Spawn New Wave Cockpit Button for those who want to cut down the time between pew pew;
- It's now easier to read destroyed building's name;
- Cockpit mode visual feedback;
- Gravity crash fix;
- Some other QOL tweaks;

Stay [b]MECH PUNK[/b]ING 

